From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:00:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/24] ASP port: Actions Semi gs702c backend, tuning, and
 renderer instrumentation

Carries the Arcade Stick Pro work that has been living uncommitted in the
working tree: the asp video backend, the makefiles, the audio and input glue,
the asp_tuning.txt loader, and the timing/frame-hash instrumentation inside the
Konami mixer.

On a branch, not master: master here tracks finalburnneo/FBNeo upstream and
these patches are ours, so they must not go near it. Nothing is pushed.

Build constraints this target imposes: -march=armv7-a -mtune=cortex-a7, never
-mcpu=cortex-a7, because the part has no hardware divide and the idiv count must
come out at 0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
